*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: sun events at 69.6 degrees north (Tromso). Sunrise and sunset do not happen in midsummer and in midwinter. The specification defines what each window means on these days, so these commands are valid. A validator can report info diagnostics.

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 1
AA SR/SS
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 2
AA SS/SR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 3
AA MON-FRI 07:00Z/SS
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 4
AA BCMT/EECT
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 019:05:00E
DP 69:36:00N 018:50:00E
DP 69:42:00N 018:50:00E
